Hero doesn't die. Converts fatal damage into unconsciousness without death, allowing ironman gameplay.

Edit the zHeroDontDie.d to make changes:
// Configurable Hero Invincibility Grace Period (in seconds after standing up from unconsciousness):
const int z_HeroCooldownSeconds = 20;

